{"id":"NCT07033026","title":"An Evaluation of NGM120 in a Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Study in Participants With Colorectal Cancer Who Have Cancer Cachexia.","official":"A Phase 2, Multicenter, Randomized, Double Blind, Placebo-controlled Study to Assess the Efficacy, Safety, and Tolerability of NGM120 in Participants With Colorectal Cancer Who Have Cancer Cachexia","summary":"A multi-center evaluation of NGM120 in a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study in participants with colorectal cancer who have cancer cachexia.","conditions":["Colorectal Cancer","CRC (Colorectal Cancer)","Cancer Cachexia"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"NGM120 Q4W"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"NGM120 Q8W"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo given"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n1. Documented active diagnosis of colorectal cancer.\n2. Cachexia defined by Fearon criteria of weight loss.\n3. Signed informed consent.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n1. Current active reversible causes of decreased food intake.\n2. Receiving tube feedings or parenteral nutrition at the time of Screening or Randomization.\n3. Have cachexia caused by other reasons.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":136,"start":"2025-06-25","pcd":"2027-04","upd":"2026-04-01","sponsor":"NGM Biopharmaceuticals, Inc","areas":["oncology"],"central":["NGM Study Director · 650-727-8800 · NGM120CX@ngmbio.com"],"sites":[{"f":"NGM Clinical Study Site","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"90033","s":"R","lat":34.0522,"lon":-118.2437,"c":"NGM Site 115 · NGM120CX@ngmbio.com"},{"f":"NGM Clinical Study Site","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"90095","s":"R","lat":34.0522,"lon":-118.2437,"c":"NGM Site 105 · NGM120CX@ngmbio.com"},{"f":"NGM Clinical Study Site","city":"Santa Rosa","pr":"California","zip":"95403","s":"R","lat":38.4405,"lon":-122.7144,"c":"NGM Site 103 · NGM120CX@ngmbio.com"},{"f":"NGM Clinical Stu